    "result_text": "The full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 2/2 tests passing).\n\nThe change is minimal and low-impact:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string field to the `Owner` schema, alongside the other derived fields (`membershipLevel`, `locality`, etc.). This regenerates `OwnerDto` with the new property.\n- **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added one `@Mapping` line deriving the value inline: `\"EMAIL\"` when `owner.getEmail()` is present (non-null, non-blank), otherwise `\"PHONE\"`.\n\nTwo files touched, no new methods, no growth to any existing method body (the mapper method's cyclomatic complexity stays at 1 \u2014 the derivation is a MapStruct expression, not procedural code), and no other class modified. Both `corePhoneWhenNoEmail` and `functionalityEmailWhenPresent` pass.",
